WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
this is yours

2
00:00:02,230 --> 00:00:03,710
Where did your kid get so much money?

3
00:00:04,470 --> 00:00:06,230
Don't do any messy things outside

4
00:00:08,020 --> 00:00:09,260
Earn money from doing business

5
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:11,820
I know a second-hand car market owner who I have a good relationship with.

6
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:26,580
I got this car at a low price. I'll give it a try. If you like it, I'll give it to you when I exchange it for a car. What can I give you?

7
00:00:26,980 --> 00:00:28,180
Keep the money to get a wife

8
00:00:31,880 --> 00:00:35,620
How long do you plan to stay when you come back this time? There is something else going on in the store.

9
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:39,700
I'll go after dinner

10
00:00:40,140 --> 00:00:41,100
Bring the expulsion account
